Database Migrations

This directory contains Alembic migrations for the orchestrator database.

To run migrations:
    cd .orchestrator && alembic -c db/alembic.ini upgrade head

To create a new migration:
    cd .orchestrator && alembic -c db/alembic.ini revision --autogenerate -m "description"

To check current version:
    cd .orchestrator && alembic -c db/alembic.ini current

To see migration history:
    cd .orchestrator && alembic -c db/alembic.ini history

Note: Migrations run automatically during setup (cli.py setup)
